    "answer": {
      "short": "False. $\\{1,2\\}\\subseteq\\{1,2,3,4\\}$.",
      "worked": "False. The listed elements are numbers, so the set $\\{1,2\\}$ is not itself a listed element. Both $1$ and $2$ belong to the right-hand set, so $\\{1,2\\}\\subseteq\\{1,2,3,4\\}$.",
